      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alamo_Beach%2C_Texas",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Alamo Beach was founded in the first decade of the twentieth century and operated a post office from 1907 to 1915.",
